					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741930508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pahsiv"
				},
				{
					"id": 741930508,
					"content": "Um, well, alright then. How long will you be out, Pahsiv? Are we gonna see you around?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741930509
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 741930509,
					"content": "See... around?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741930510
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pahsiv"
				},
				{
					"id": 741930510,
					"content": "Well, that's how we express the desire to meet again!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741930511
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 741930511,
					"content": "\"See you around\" is how we say goodbye.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741930512
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741930512,
					"content": "That's right. We did say previously that we'll teach you how to say goodbye, didn't we? Well, why don't you try saying it?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741930513
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 741930513,
					"content": "Good... bye?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741930514
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pahsiv"
				},
				{
					"id": 741930514,
					"content": "Uh, do you not know what that means?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741930515
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 741930515,
					"content": "Hmm... Well, you can consider it a sort of exchange or swap, too. Kinda like swapping one tomorrow for another...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741930516
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 741930516,
					"content": "You take a bit of your tomorrow and give it to us, and we'll give a bit of ours to you — and that's how we'll meet again! What do you think? Get it now?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741930517
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 741930517,
					"content": "Swap tomorrow... for tomorrow! Pahsiv!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741930518
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pahsiv"
				},
				{
					"id": 741930518,
					"content": "Hehe, looks like you get it! In that case, let's say \"see you around\" for now — that way, we'll definitely meet again!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741930519
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 741930519,
					"content": "See you around! Pahsiv!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741930520
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 741930520,
					"content": "See ya!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741930521
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741930521,
					"content": "#See you, {NICKNAME}! See you, Paimon!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Pahsiv"
				}
			]
		}
	]
